#: woocommerce/class-woocommercerestrictions.php:146
msgid ""
"Off by default. When enabled, guests and non-SOL accounts cannot purchase "
"any product. This overrides individual product settings; organisation and "
"role restrictions still apply."
msgstr ""

#: woocommerce/class-woocommercerestrictions.php:224
msgid ""
"Off by default. Require a signed-in SOL account to order this product, even "
"when no organisation or role is selected. Guests and non-SOL accounts are "
"blocked, including after logout with items already in the cart. Organisation "
"and role rules apply only when the roles scope is enabled. The global "
"setting under WooCommerce > Settings > Products can require SOL sign-in for "
"all products and cannot be overridden here."
msgstr ""

#: woocommerce/class-woocommercerestrictions.php:227
msgid ""
"SOL sign-in is currently required for all products by the global WooCommerce "
"setting, regardless of this checkbox."
msgstr ""

#: woocommerce/class-woocommercerestrictions.php:231
msgid ""
"The roles scope is disabled. Saved organisation and role restrictions are "
"paused and preserved. Only the product or global SOL sign-in requirement "
"applies; without it, these products may be purchased by guests."
msgstr ""

#: woocommerce/class-woocommercerestrictions.php:234
msgid ""
"Select organisations or roles that may order this product. A customer needs "
"one matching active organisation or role. Enable Require both organisation "
"and role to match both fields on the same active assignment when both fields "
"contain selections; with only one field selected, only that field is "
"required. Include descendant organisations to match assignments in groups "
"beneath a selected parent; turn it off to require a direct assignment in a "
"selected organisation. Leave both allow fields empty to allow every customer "
"unless a deny rule matches."
msgstr ""

